        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Thanksgiving</strong> is a short, experimental platforming adventure with a mix of sci-fi and light horror elements. Explore mysterious environments, uncover hidden secrets, and test your skills through challenging platforming sequences. Inspired by late-90s classics, the game features optional retro visual filters, a nostalgic 4:3 aspect ratio, low-poly inspired graphics, and tight, rewarding gameplay designed for fans of old-school platformers. The perfect game to play this Thanksgiving season. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦃  Help a turkey find its way home in this 90s-inspired lo-fi retro adventure!  🦃</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short, experimental indie game designed to be completed in one sitting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436580/extras/0368c04dad6150d0c6728436f0813eb0.poster.avif?t=1765333764\" width=630 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436580/extras/0368c04dad6150d0c6728436f0813eb0.webm?t=1765333764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436580/extras/0368c04dad6150d0c6728436f0813eb0.mp4?t=1765333764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Controller support / Universal Controller support - Works with most gamepads including third-party ones such as 8BitDo controllers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PSX-inspired, wobbly, mind-boggling graphics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro 4:3 aspect ratio with a low resolution of 960x720.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional VHS and CRT retro filters that can be toggled on or off.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annoying turkey sounds... Corn... family gatherings...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436580/extras/704afd87d3c3ec1d628c04d513714816.poster.avif?t=1765333764\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436580/extras/704afd87d3c3ec1d628c04d513714816.webm?t=1765333764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436580/extras/704afd87d3c3ec1d628c04d513714816.mp4?t=1765333764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle VHS and CRT filters on or off to capture that nostalgic 90s vibe! 📺</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can easily access them from the pause menu or quickly cycle through them with a single press of the Select button on your controller or the F key on your keyboard.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436580/extras/0222b094d04db3ac437bc21d7ffea01d.poster.avif?t=1765333764\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436580/extras/0222b094d04db3ac437bc21d7ffea01d.webm?t=1765333764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436580/extras/0222b094d04db3ac437bc21d7ffea01d.mp4?t=1765333764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Look for the “Samer Khatib Official Seal Of Quality™” in our works!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"h